@Text editor
 ^A   word left
 ^C   scroll page down
 ^D   right
 @D   copy character from above
 ^E   up
 ^F   word right
 ^G   delete right
 ^H   delete left
 ^J   next line
 @J   join line
 ^L   repeat find
 ^M   line break
 ^N   split line
 ^P   add character code
 ^QC  end of document
 ^QD  end of line
 ^QE  top of screen
 ^QF  find
 ^QI  go to line
 ^QR  beginning of document
 ^QS  beginning of line
 ^QX  bottom of screen
 ^QY  delete to end of line
 ^R   scroll page up
 ^S   left
 @S   copy character from left
 ^T   delete word right
 ^V   toggle insert/overwrite
 ^W   scroll line up
 @W   copy line from above
 ^X   down
 ^Y   destroy line
 ^Z   scroll line down
 ^_   insert space
 F10  exit

(^ = control; @ = alt)
